  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 6194,
      "text": "For the accustomed security of the Quraysh[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 106,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قُرَيۡشٍ",
        "englishName": "Quraish",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Quraysh",
        "numberOfAyahs": 4,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 602,
      "ruku": 548,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6195,
      "text": "secure in their winter and summer journeys[2].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 106,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قُرَيۡشٍ",
        "englishName": "Quraish",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Quraysh",
        "numberOfAyahs": 4,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 602,
      "ruku": 548,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6196,
      "text": "Let them worship the Lord of this [Sacred] House[3],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 106,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قُرَيۡشٍ",
        "englishName": "Quraish",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Quraysh",
        "numberOfAyahs": 4,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 602,
      "ruku": 548,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6197,
      "text": "Who fed them against hunger and made them secure against fear[4].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 106,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قُرَيۡشٍ",
        "englishName": "Quraish",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Quraysh",
        "numberOfAyahs": 4,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 602,
      "ruku": 548,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6198,
      "text": "Have you seen the one who denies the Recompense?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 107,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَاعُونِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Maa'un",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Almsgiving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 7,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 602,
      "ruku": 549,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6199,
      "text": "Such is the one who repulses the orphan harshly,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 107,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَاعُونِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Maa'un",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Almsgiving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 7,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 602,
      "ruku": 549,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6200,
      "text": "and does not urge others to feed the needy.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 107,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَاعُونِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Maa'un",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Almsgiving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 7,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 602,
      "ruku": 549,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6201,
      "text": "So woe to those who pray,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 107,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَاعُونِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Maa'un",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Almsgiving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 7,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 602,
      "ruku": 549,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6202,
      "text": "but are heedless of their prayer[1];",
      "surah": {
        "number": 107,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَاعُونِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Maa'un",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Almsgiving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 7,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 602,
      "ruku": 549,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6203,
      "text": "those who only show off,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 107,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَاعُونِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Maa'un",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Almsgiving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 7,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 602,
      "ruku": 549,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6204,
      "text": "and withhold even the small kindnesses.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 107,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المَاعُونِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Maa'un",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Almsgiving",
        "numberOfAyahs": 7,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 602,
      "ruku": 549,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6205,
      "text": "We have surely given you [O Prophet] al-Kauthar [i.e., abundance][1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 108,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَوۡثَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kawthar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Abundance",
        "numberOfAyahs": 3,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 602,
      "ruku": 550,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6206,
      "text": "so pray and offer sacrifice to your Lord alone.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 108,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَوۡثَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kawthar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Abundance",
        "numberOfAyahs": 3,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 602,
      "ruku": 550,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6207,
      "text": "Indeed, the one who hates you is truly cut off [from all goodness][2].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 108,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَوۡثَرِ",
